From db5fa3cc089579e5817739660bd4276d07fd288a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Sat, 4 Apr 2026 00:34:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/14] refactor: extract shared download helpers into
 lib/download.bzl

Download logic (integrity checking, download arg building, patch
application) was tangled into the repository rule. Extract it into
lib/download.bzl to separate concerns and make it independently
testable.
